// ============================================================
// Storefront: the thinking around the event sources, the given contexts and the seed data - sticky notes on their canvases.
//
// A note says what a decision was, what is still open, what we assume and what could go wrong, beside the cards it is about.
// Colours: green decision, yellow question, blue assumption, pink risk. Authoring metadata only: it never reaches the running application.
// ============================================================

sticky note on eventsources
  description "[DECISION] Basket and Order are separate event sources: a basket is thrown away freely, an order never is. Checkout is the only place one turns into the other."
  colour green
  position 1210 150
  size 270 190

sticky note on eventsources
  description "[QUESTION] Does a returning shopper's basket follow them across devices? That would make the shopper, not the basket, the event source."
  colour yellow
  position 1210 360
  size 270 190

sticky note on givencontexts
  description "[DECISION] A product on sale is the starting point of every browsing and basket specification. It is listed with a price and stock, never an unapproved product."
  colour green
  position 1210 150
  size 270 190

sticky note on seeddata
  description "[ASSUMPTION] Storefront lists what Catalog approved and Warehouse has on the shelf. The seed carries only the listing, never prices of its own."
  colour blue
  position 560 150
  size 270 190
